":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":119295270501443,"name":"[NEW START & 4X EXP] Ripple Game","desc":"Venice 1939, rumors of blood-sucking monsters beginning to spread around the area. Something within you demands answers.\n\n>> This is a 3 life perma-death progression based PvPvE game inspired by the first two parts in the manga JoJo's Bizarre Adventure by Hirohiko Araki, enter at your own risk. 👀 <<\n\nDEFAULT CONTROLS;\nM1: Light Punch\nM2: Heavy Punch\nDouble Tap W/Ctrl: Sprint\nQ: Dash\nSprinting + Space: Dive\nDouble Tap Space (With Hamon Breathing): Hamon Climb\nHold Space (Undead): Super Jump\nG: Charge Hamon\nE: Secondary\nR: Tertiary\n\nType \":CMDS\" for Commands List\nPress Tab to open Inventory & Masteries (Combat tool may spawn in it sometimes)\n\n! Join our Game Community Server for progress & upcoming release date !","path":"/game/119295270501443-new-start-4x-exp-ripple-game","slug":"119295270501443-new-start-4x-exp-ripple-game","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/577e92dd7c7b889e4a8fb0f17914ce1b395b7f497ec3f13741fb0ac44b92881d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-abed33205628e56fa0fd9fdb3af87b7a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":1263666,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-19T20:11:59.940Z","creator":{"name":"Development Tendency","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":112263837967695,"name":"+1 Size Keyboard Escape","desc":"📏 Welcome to +1 Size Keyboard Escape! \nTrain to grow, then run to the end... if you're big enough.\n\n🧍↕  Every step = +1 Size\n👟 Run & jump to escape the facility made of satisfying keys\n💪 Train your size and unlock massive multipliers\n🌍 Become the BIGGEST on the server\n🎧 Listen to the smooth keyboard click sounds as you grow\n\n🎁 Join our group + 👍 Like Game for 5,000 FREE SIZE!","path":"/game/112263837967695-1-size-keyboard-escape","slug":"112263837967695-1-size-keyboard-escape","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/878bfd594ecb8d62002af490701aa53ef4c9e48002677f0309cbbad74b285ae1.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-710e7fef5b007564ca4034c3b3f719a0/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":1003709,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-22T21:37:32.306Z","creator":{"name":"Clean Strike Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":97262361158655,"name":"Combat Tower Obby [Abyss of Pain]","desc":"An obby game inspired by Tower of Hell, but here, instead of climbing up, you jump down and have access to weapons and items to sabotage and troll other players.\n\nDive into the ultimate Roblox obby challenge where you race downward through insane obstacles! Reach the bottom of the tower before the clock runs out. \nEngage in battles with other players as you descend, testing your reflexes and strategy against both the environment and human enemies.\n\nPlot your course, there are multiple paths you can take to get to the bottom floor.\nEarn coins and gems to buy items & weapons to knock opponents down, sabotage their progress, and be the first to reach the bottom. \nDodge traps, fight enemies, and master crazy jumps in the chaotic descent.\n\nThe tower is randomly generated, with obby stages of different difficulty ranging from easy to hard to impossible.\n\nEscape the Abyss to earn rewards and buffs to troll other players.\n\nBe sure to like 👍 and favourite ⭐ for new obby stages and updates.","path":"/game/97262361158655-combat-tower-obby-abyss-of-pain","slug":"97262361158655-combat-tower-obby-abyss-of-pain","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/f7566d4f8fd0e7d2252cf6d82cf08a8f3531960c73c2e60054f5be81b44ce8a3.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a8976bfb67fba0dd261060fd3ed2aceb/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":252342,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-19T16:07:16.360Z","creator":{"name":"B.R.G. Studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"